div.p:
(1) If Jewish emigration reaches 10,000 and some political prisoners are
                    released, the U.S. will give its blessing to the sale of licensable energy
                    technology;

(2) If Jewish emigration reaches the rate of 25,000 per year and most political
                    prisoners are released, we will review U.S. export controls with the goal of
                    making them no more stringent than Cocom controls in general;
